  The circuit:
  - +5 V -> 220 ohm resistor -> LED anode, LED cathode -> P1.x
    (the same for all eight pins P1.0 to P1.7; a LOW pin lights its LED)

  You can modify this code and save it with another file name to simulate in
  VSA Simulator.

